[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m bit patterns a `char` can hold is accepted and produces output. The classic
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m generic boundaries (null pointer, zero length, oversized length, out-of-range
